id: pm-gantt-chart-hound-esm
title: Stop Hound from linting generated dist/ output
description: "Disable Hound JSHint using the pm-slack and pm-web precedent: committed dist/ JavaScript targets ES2022, while Hound defaults to ES5 and produces false positives."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: ci,review-bots
created_at: "2026-10-17T11:40:05.388Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-27T04:19:36.775Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Hound no longer lints generated dist/ output; no other lint or gate changes
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-17T12:20:07.761Z",codex-agent,Verified all 19 Hound threads target generated ESM in dist. Match the sibling pm-graph .jshintignore exclusions for dist and node_modules; source ESLint and TypeScript checks remain active. No source syntax change is needed.
  "2026-10-17T12:39:38.205Z",codex-agent,"Round 1 verification: .jshintignore is byte-identical to the sibling pm-graph policy and excludes only dist and node_modules. Canonical source ESLint passes. npm run release:check and bun run release:check each pass 249/249 tests, zero failures/skips, 100% lines/branches/functions for all three gated runtime sources, zero duplication, production audit, and all three packed acceptance scenarios. No runtime source or generated output changed. After the configuration push, reply and resolve only the 19 Hound parser-mode threads."
  "2026-10-23T15:27:11.672Z",codex-agent,"STALE-CLAIM: audited main 9c887a56a99c7108591d9f223d09e3937ecf3e55; no open PR or recently pushed live branch references this record. Inspected: .jshintignore. Remaining: Generated-output exclusions are present, but retained local lint/full-gate results do not prove the external Hound parser acceptance after the config push. Verify the actual service outcome before declaring this integration delivered. Release historical contention and retain real work as open; no delivery/cancellation is claimed."
  "2026-10-27T04:01:35.246Z",codex-agent,"Reuse the existing Hound record and preserve its append-only history. The earlier .jshintignore exclusions did not establish external Hound parser acceptance. Follow the explicit pm-slack and pm-web .hound.yml precedent by disabling only Hound JSHint; retain existing exclusions, source lint and all release gates. Reclassify this work as a Chore, verify a failing configuration revert proof, run both unchanged release gates with limited workers and isolated Git identity, regenerate the changelog from fetched tags, and open an unmerged PR. The item remains unclosed for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-27T04:01:38.052Z",codex-agent,"Configuration revert proof: the focused Node assertion passes with .hound.yml present, fails when the new file is removed, then passes after restoring its exact bytes. No source behavior or package gates change."
  "2026-10-27T04:19:35.047Z",codex-agent,"Validation complete: focused configuration assertion and both unchanged release:check gates passed under isolated Git identity with at most two test workers. Changelog regenerated from fetched tags; final changelog:check follows all tracker writes. No lint, gate, source, dependency or generated dist changes. Hound service behavior will be observable on the PR; no merge authorized. Measured test counts: npm: 363 tests in each full suite; gate exit 0; bun: 363 tests in each full suite; gate exit 0. Reused the existing Hound item as a Chore under the same ID; the original history remains a byte-identical prefix and existing exclusions and lint configuration are preserved."
files[4]{path,scope}:
  .hound.yml,project
  .jshintignore,project
  scripts/lint.ts,project
  tsconfig.json,project
tests[4]:
  - command: npm run lint
    scope: project
    provenance:
      author: codex-agent
      created_at: "2026-10-17T12:20:13.874Z"
      source_kind: local_mutation
      source_ref: brand/triplicate-visuals
  - command: "node -e \"require('node:assert/strict').match(require('node:fs').readFileSync('.hound.yml','utf8'), /^jshint:\\n  enabled: false\\s*$/m)\""
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 7200
    pm_context_mode: tracker
    workspace_context_mode: source
    provenance:
      author: codex-agent
      created_at: "2026-10-27T04:01:38.769Z"
      source_kind: local_mutation
      source_ref: chore/hound-generated-dist
  - command: "HOME=\"$(mktemp -d)\" GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 taskset -c 0,1,2 npm run release:check"
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 7200
    pm_context_mode: tracker
    workspace_context_mode: source
    provenance:
      author: codex-agent
      created_at: "2026-10-27T04:01:39.478Z"
      source_kind: local_mutation
      source_ref: chore/hound-generated-dist
  - command: "HOME=\"$(mktemp -d)\" GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 taskset -c 0,1,2 bun run release:check"
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 7200
    pm_context_mode: tracker
    workspace_context_mode: source
    provenance:
      author: codex-agent
      created_at: "2026-10-27T04:01:40.219Z"
      source_kind: local_mutation
      source_ref: chore/hound-generated-dist
